KeywordAbility(
    name: "replicate",
    params: [Cost],
    spelling: "replicate <Param(0)>",
    grammar: FixedKeyword(
        surface: "replicate",
    ),
    // STOP (waits on: `semantics-v2-spell-copies`).
    // "Replicate [cost]" means "As an additional cost to cast this
    // spell, you may pay [cost] any number of times" and "When you cast this spell, if a
    // replicate cost was paid for it, copy it for each time its replicate cost was paid. If
    // the spell has any targets, you may choose new targets for any of the copies."
    // [CR#702.56a] The cost is `addedCost(Param(0), true, AnyNumberOfTimes)` and the count
    // `timesPaid`, as squad's are; what remains is "if the spell has any targets", which no
    // `Condition` reads (the cause Casualty and Epic share).
)
